Here's the problem file for moving lettuce from CounterTop to DiningTable:

```pddl
(define (problem move_lettuce_problem)
  (:domain robot2)
  (:objects
    robot2 - robot
    Lettuce - object
    CounterTop - object
    DiningTable - object
  )
  (:init
    (at robot2 CounterTop)
    (at-location Lettuce CounterTop)
    (not (inaction robot2))
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location Lettuce DiningTable)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.